# TypeScript conventions

## Language

- New code: `.ts` / `.tsx` only. Convert or delete leftover `.js` / `.jsx` when touching a feature.
- Prefer explicit props types and `import type { ... }`.

## Types location

```
container/<domain>/<feature>/types.ts   ← entity + FormValues + Payload
types/api.ts                            ← ApiCudResponse, ApiListResponse only
```

- Same-folder imports: `./types`
- Components import feature types from `@/container/.../types`
- Cross-feature FK options: import the other feature’s types/API (e.g. room types for room-details dropdown)

## Naming

- API row shapes match Resort fields (`Room_TId`, `Category_Id`, …)
- Form values use request body keys (`room_tname`, `categ_name`, …)
- Components: `*Toolbar`, `*Table`, `*FormDialog`, `*DeleteDialog`

## Do not

- Reintroduce demoAuth / mock list arrays
- Put feature types back into a single bloated `types/api.ts`
- Use `any` unless bridging a third-party gap (prefer `unknown` + narrow)
